  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.36 with immutable ProGPU preview.42 and its native SIMD pixel conversion; adds typed native activation and deterministic popup-local diagnostics through the real native input path; selects alpha-capable X11/XWayland visuals for transparent windows; maps ShowActivated=false windows without stealing focus; stabilizes transient ComboBox and menu placement; stops static-frame GPU rendering and bounds retained render-resource caches; consumes the typed, reflection-free ProGPU media drawing-state bridge; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
